Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 08:39:28 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 477/488] [DS4.1] Router: a forward's image-token and routing
 masks in one TileLang launch

TileKernels' gate takes the image tokens and the rows to route as bool masks,
which the router computed once a forward with torch: two comparisons and a
conjunction of the input ids, and the negation of the padding mask.
routing_masks_kernel computes both in one launch (or either alone) for the
first routing layer of a forward; later layers find them cached as before.
The gate router declares every combination its gate path can launch.
